OL,3,GNEWSADeveloper's building to be
OL,4,Ademolished by council
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council will demolish an unsafe
OL,7,Fsix-storey block of flats after its
OL,8,Fdeveloper failed to tear it down
OL,9,Ffollowing planning breaches.
OL,11,FMarcus Fielding was previously found
OL,12,Fguilty of failing to prevent people
OL,13,Ffrom being put in danger by the
OL,14,Fbuilding in Job's Lane, Kettering,
OL,15,FNorthamptonshire.
OL,17,FNorth Northamptonshire Council took
OL,18,FHigh Court action against Fielding, as
OL,19,Fwell as Michigan Construction,
OL,20,FFielding's company, to demolish the
OL,21,Fbuilding.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
