OL,3,GNEWSADeveloper's building to be
OL,4,Ademolished by council
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen the work was not carried out by
OL,7,FApril 2024, a High Court ruling allowed
OL,8,Fthe council "to seek to demolish the
OL,9,Fbuilding in default", and a demolition
OL,10,Fnotice has been submitted, the council
OL,11,Fconfirmed.
